## What happened

**The tape was risk-off** (SPY −1.14%, VIX +9.55% → 18.93, gold −4.8%/miners −9.5%, BTC −6.5%, NKE −7.1%) — the May Core PCE likely ran hot, which **falsified the macro agent's GDX thesis** (it claimed a cool-PCE gold rally; gold actually crashed).

| Agent | Pick | Conv | Outcome |
|---|---|---|---|
| macro | GDX | 8 | **Falsified by live tape** + 0.5× hard rule. Dead. |
| crypto | PASS | 5 | BTC stuck at lows, no reversal; CLSK already held. |
| quant | XLI | 6 | Paper-only (suspended → 07-08); `quant-min-conviction-8` rule fires. |
| sentiment | PASS | 2 | KMX insider claim unverifiable in SEC data; +11.5% = late-stage. |
| **contrarian** | **LULU** | **8** | **VETO'd in debate** ↓ |
| catalyst | NKE | 8 | Below 8.0 bar (~4.9); −7% falling knife into earnings. |

**Capital Protection Gate — LULU → VETO.** The sole live candidate got a `fatal_flaw` from the Bear (strength 8) and the Bull **conceded** (strength → 3). Both sides independently confirmed via the Yahoo tape that the thesis was built on a **wrong catalyst date** (Q4 earnings already landed Jun 4 and was priced negative — not "Jun 30"), a **miscounted beat streak** (3, not 4), and an **earnings-driven drawdown**, not a "PR" overreaction. The firm had already sold LULU on Jun 2 to dodge that same earnings binary.

## Portfolio
- **NAV $10,538.06 (+5.38%)** — up from premarket $10,326 on the **MU post-earnings rip** (+14.9%, beat confirmed).
- **SPY +31.83% → alpha −26.44%** (improved from −28.70%).
- **No sells** — all 8 positions above stops; MU/FDX earnings beats holding, CAT (+26%) winner running, CLSK holds into tomorrow's Jun-26 production release (BTC $59,142 > $58K falsification).
- **VIX 18.93** (≤25 → 15–30% sizing tier, moot since no buy).

## Notable operational findings
- **Finnhub key died** (401 "Invalid API key") mid-session — switched to the **Yahoo Finance chart API** for all live quotes (recorded in memory). Critical: **agent-sourced intraday directions were wrong** (macro claimed a gold rally that didn't happen) — I verified every price via curl before scoring.
